Plotting the marginal posterior of $k$

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
# Plot histogram from stan draws
postsamples <- extract(fit, pars = c("beta_","k"))
hist(postsamples$k, 50, freq = FALSE, col = colors[5], 
     xlab = expression(k), ylab = "posterior density", 
     main = expression(k))
```

